      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Automatic mirroring based on camera facing</para>
          <para>This is the default mirroring mode for the camera device. With this mode, the camera output is mirrored horizontally for front-facing cameras. There is no mirroring for rear-facing and external cameras.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/params/OutputConfiguration#MIRROR_MODE_AUTO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.params.OutputConfiguration.MIRROR_MODE_AUTO</code>.</a></format></para>
